        "TileImage": "$($repository 1f6cbfc3-06d5-49b2-9eca-ca22bde2bbf3).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47, we recieved valuable intel about three heads that work along Francesca De Santis in the Ether Lab&apos;s virus.\r\rViana Buccho, a bright and ambitious scientist who recently feels an utter remorse.\r\rDr. Omar Lafayette, Silvio Caruso&apos;s private therapist and spymaster.\r\rRoberto Vargas, Silvio&apos;s golf coach and Francesca&apos;s secret lover.\r\rEliminate the targets along with Francesca herself, we must stop them from releasing that virus.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
